    "code": " case'dial':label='细微调节 / 清楚反馈';figure=`<svg class=\"x-svg x-dial\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 280\" aria-label=\"参数旋钮\" role=\"slider\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" tabindex=\"0\"><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"140\" r=\"84\" fill=\"#d7ddd0\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"140\" r=\"72\" fill=\"#f9f8ed\" stroke=\"#fffef7\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>${Array.from({length:51},(_,i)=>{let a=(-225+i*5.4)*Math.PI/180;return`<line class=\"x-dial-tick\" x1=\"${200+Math.cos(a)*95}\" y1=\"${140+Math.sin(a)*95}\" x2=\"${200+Math.cos(a)*(i%5?101:106)}\" y2=\"${140+Math.sin(a)*(i%5?101:106)}\" stroke=\"#8f9d87\" stroke-width=\"${i%5?1:2}\"/>`;}).join('')}<g class=\"x-dial-needle\"><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"84\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#55745a\"/></g><text class=\"x-dial-value\" x=\"200\" y=\"149\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"175\" text-anchor=\"middle\">强度 / %</text></svg>`;break;",
